      "unit": "mg/m2",
      "route": "IV",
      "days": [
        1
      ],
      "notes": "Methotrexate 12 g/m2 (cap 20 g) IV over 4 hours with vigorous alkalinized hydration and leucovorin rescue."
    },
    {
